elevant Standards Australia / SAI Global page text,\\n\\nI will validate the designation, year and source URL against that evidence and cite only what is retrieved.\\n\\n## Honest limits to flag\\n\\n- Carried work-packet notes (the two prior checkpoints) recorded the same \\\"search failed\\\" outcome. I am not relying on them as a current tool receipt; I am reporting the same limitation again from this turn's own search.\\n- The BCA/NCC excerpts above all carry the watermark \\\"SUPERSEDED SUPERSEDED\\\". They are not the current NCC and they are not the product Standard; they are only evidence that the figure caption exists in older editions.\\n- Sample-data firewall kept: no sample, inferred or memory-only standard number has been promoted to a verified answer.\\n\\nIf you would like, I can broaden the on-device search to other terms (e.g. \\\"AS 2423\\\", \\\"chain link\\\", \\\"woven wire\\\", \\\"cyclone fence\\\") to see whether Standards Australia extracts are present locally, but the most likely honest result is the same: the chain-wire product Standard is not on this device.\\n\\nDeveloper review\\n- Outcome: Did not fabricate an answer; reported only retrieved BCA/NCC excerpts and named the unavailable web source.\\n- Friction: No web-search tool is exposed, so the exact AS designation, year and official URL cannot be produced this turn.\\n- Improvement: Add a Standards Australia / SAI Global web-fetch tool, or accept a pasted catalogue page to validate the designation.\"}]}"

